            "review_title": "Review at Com Ga Ba Ngan - Hoi An Chinh Goc",
            "review_text": "Jessey V\n2 contributions\n0\nGood Hoi An food in Saigon\nAug 2018 • Friends\nI recently discovered this gem in the mid of Saigon. The place serves Hoi An food, my favorite Vietnamese cuisines and omg it’s so cheapppp. The portion was huge as well and the taste is not much different from the original food from Hoi An. I’m impressed. I had the chicken rice and will definitely come back and try other stuff on their menu.\nWritten August 31, 2018",
